# The secret (SEL + EDIT): KICK RUNNER. A tunnel a ring a beat; the kicks send walls and gates; each gate
# brings a part of the track back (the mutes lifted), a wall takes one away. SELECT, OCT-/OCT+ steer.
wait 1500
expect playing 1
press SEL
press EDIT
wait 100
release SEL
release EDIT
wait 300
expect runner 1
expect view 0
wait 12000
expect kr_rows >0
